OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA bright day with a mix of
OL,6,Fsunny spells and showers, the showers
OL,7,Fbecoming heavier and more frequent,
OL,8,Fespecially in the west, through the
OL,9,Fafternoon. Best of the sunshine
OL,10,Ftowards Inverness and the Black Isle.
OL,11,FFresh southwesterly winds easing.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FClear spells and occasionally
OL,14,Fheavy showers continue through the
OL,15,Fevening and overnight, especially in
OL,16,Fnorth and west. Chilly, risk of a
OL,17,Ftouch of ground frost especially in
OL,18,Fsheltered eastern parts.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
