OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CWednesday:FAnother day of sunny spells
OL,6,Fand occasionally heavy showers, wintry
OL,7,Fover mountains, the showers easing a
OL,8,Flittle through the afternoon and
OL,9,Fevening. Occasionally fresh
OL,10,Fsouthwesterly then northwesterly winds.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:FDry,
OL,13,Fbright morning Thursday but increasing
OL,14,Fcloud brings occasionally heavy rain
OL,15,Fthrough the afternoon. Rain clears
OL,16,Fovernight to leave Friday and Saturday
OL,17,Fwith sunny spells and frequent heavy,
OL,18,Fblustery showers.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
